{
  "dom_id": "step-e14854",
  "name": "Example: Finding the Axis of Symmetry From the X-Intercepts",
  "problem": "Find the axis of symmetry for the parabola sketched below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14224890/assets/e5393f15ff154f1f4cc310791790db0fe0ad0d9faa076d10f3f6ec7b481de086.png)",
  "worked_solution": "From the graph, we deduce that the roots are $x_1=-3$ and $x_2=2.$ \n\nTo find the axis of symmetry, we take the average of the roots, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}}{2}=\\frac{-3+2}{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the axis of symmetry is $x=-\\dfrac{1}{2}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e14854\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding the Axis of Symmetry From the X-Intercepts</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e14854\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <p>Find the axis of symmetry for the parabola sketched below.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-50a5104720698c9ec71bdcfe6cbb8163\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/50a5104720698c9ec71bdcfe6cbb8163\"></div>\n                    </div>     \n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleExplanation\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n         